items.a:
- [[g:Virtual Threads]] (final): lightweight concurrency kiểu thread-per-request, scale triệu I/O task
- [[g:Pattern matching for switch]] + record deconstruction: viết logic rất expressive
- Sequenced Collections: API thống nhất first/last/reversed
- Structured concurrency (preview), Scoped Values (preview), Generational ZGC

**Code cũ đặt cạnh code Java 21:**
<pre><code><span class="c">// Trước 21</span>
<span class="k">if</span> (e <span class="k">instanceof</span> Refund) {
    Refund r = (Refund) e;
    <span class="k">if</span> (r.<span class="f">amount</span>() &gt; <span class="n">0</span>) <span class="f">refund</span>(r.<span class="f">id</span>(), r.<span class="f">amount</span>());
} <span class="k">else</span> <span class="k">if</span> (e <span class="k">instanceof</span> Charge) {
    <span class="f">charge</span>((Charge) e);
}
<span class="c">    </span>
<span class="c">// Java 21: pattern matching for switch + tách record; sealed nên không cần default</span>
<span class="k">switch</span> (e) {
    <span class="k">case</span> Refund(<span class="k">var</span> id, <span class="k">var</span> amount) <span class="k">when</span> amount &gt; <span class="n">0</span> -&gt; <span class="f">refund</span>(id, amount);
    <span class="k">case</span> Charge c                              -&gt; <span class="f">charge</span>(c);
    <span class="k">case</span> <span class="k">null</span>                                 -&gt; <span class="k">throw</span> <span class="k">new</span> IllegalArgumentException();
}
<span class="c">    </span>
<span class="c">// Java 21: mỗi task một thread thật, không còn pool để mà chỉnh</span>
<span class="k">try</span> (<span class="k">var</span> exec = Executors.<span class="f">newVirtualThreadPerTaskExecutor</span>()) {
    routes.<span class="f">forEach</span>(r -&gt; exec.<span class="f">submit</span>(() -&gt; gds.<span class="f">search</span>(r)));
}                                              <span class="c">// close() chờ mọi task xong</span></code></pre>

:::deep
- pattern matching for switch + record deconstruction → xử lý data rất expressive
- Sequenced Collections thống nhất `getFirst/getLast/reversed`
- Generational ZGC (21) giảm CPU overhead so với ZGC non-gen

**Migration virtual threads** — gần như [[g:'drop-in']] cho service blocking (Spring Boot 3.2+: `spring.threads.virtual.enabled=true`), nhưng:
- [[r:audit `synchronized`]] ở hot path (pinning)
- vẫn phải giới hạn downstream resource (VT không tự bảo vệ DB khỏi 10k concurrent query — cần pool/semaphore)
:::
